{"id":"pre_cieux","lemma":"précieux","pos":"adj","rank":2044,"glosses":["precious"],"ipa":"/pʁe.sjø/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/2b/Fr-pr%C3%A9cieux.ogg/Fr-pr%C3%A9cieux.ogg.mp3","forms":{"feminine":"précieuse","masculinePlural":"précieux","femininePlural":"précieuses"},"formAudio":{"précieuse":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f6/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-pr%C3%A9cieuse.wav","précieuses":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0f/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-pr%C3%A9cieuses.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Il est précieux pour nous.","en":"He is precious to us.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"we / us"}]},{"text":"Mon temps est très précieux.","en":"My time is very valuable.","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"time"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"very"},null]},{"text":"Je pris une précieuse leçon.","en":"I learned a valuable lesson.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to take","l":"prendre"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"lesson"}]},{"text":"La santé est la chose la plus précieuse.","en":"Health is the most precious thing.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"health"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"thing"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"more / no longer"},null]},{"text":"Nous avons perdu un temps précieux.","en":"We've lost valuable time.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"lost"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"time"},null]}]}